      "layout": "vertical",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "nUKHj",
          "name": "Hero",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 36,
          "padding": [
            32,
            80,
            72,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "SyT14",
              "name": "Nav",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "justifyContent": "space_between",
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yUVO1",
                  "name": "Wordmark",
                  "fill": "#1C1B19",
                  "content": "IMAGINAL AIRLINES",
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.6
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WNawJ",
                  "name": "Flight mark",
                  "fill": "#1C1B19",
                  "content": "FLIGHT 001",
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.6
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "l02PP",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#D8D4CC",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "V8Llz",
              "name": "Intro",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "P6KhAd",
                  "name": "Eyebrow",
                  "fill": "#6F6B64",
                  "content": "FLIGHT 001    ·    THE IMAGINAL REALM",
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.8
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "KuM8m",
                  "name": "Headline",
                  "fill": "#1C1B19",
                  "content": "Not a flight\nto a place.",
                  "lineHeight": 0.95,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 68,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "q4reP",
                  "name": "Lede",
                  "width": 680,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 14,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "tce3A",
                      "name": "Lede one",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A meticulously guided journey into the geometry of your own consciousness. Imaginal Airlines builds an airport and an airplane as a frame, so the border being crossed is an internal one.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "B2VQOs",
                      "name": "Lede two",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The practice is Neural-Field Annealing. Gentle heat, a malleable state, then a slow cooling. The field of consciousness is invited to loosen, and then to settle in a more coherent shape.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "MMCxY",
          "name": "Whole",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#0C0C0B",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 36,
          "padding": [
            72,
            80,
            80,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nzDRa",
              "name": "Kicker",
              "fill": "#C8C3BA",
              "content": "THE FIELD",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1.8
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "VDgX1",
              "name": "Head",
              "width": 720,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "s6CMq",
                  "name": "Headline",
                  "fill": "#F3F1EC",
                  "content": "Where the knots are.",
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 44,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LkbRv",
                  "name": "Deck",
                  "fill": "#D4D0C8",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A life lays down areas of high charge. Stress, repetitive thought, trauma, contraction. They stiffen, the way a knot stiffens metal, and they narrow awareness, joy, and choice. Annealing warms a rigid structure until it can move, then lets it cool into a new form. This flight is that process.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Fx7km",
              "name": "Stage",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
