                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "DzBKm",
                  "name": "Caption",
                  "width": 768,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "RZYbf",
                      "name": "Caption kicker",
                      "fill": "#B7B2A9",
                      "content": "HELD IN SOUND AND IMAGE",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.6
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N0d8MP",
                      "name": "Caption body",
                      "fill": "#D4D0C8",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Permissive, loving attention is the first law of the airline. Not a force. A saturation. The picture and the sound are how that attention is kept in the room.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "aZkHk",
          "name": "Inside",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 36,
          "padding": [
            88,
            80,
            72,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ivq86",
              "name": "Kicker",
              "fill": "#6F6B64",
              "content": "THREE PHASES",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1.8
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Rpwlv",
              "name": "Open",
              "width": 680,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dDOC3",
                  "name": "Headline",
                  "fill": "#1C1B19",
                  "content": "Heat, then space, then a slow return.",
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 44,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "SO9LO",
                  "name": "Deck",
                  "fill": "#3A3834",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Two and a half hours, boarding to disembarking. Most of the journey is spent lying down, in a low-light room. The order is the method.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "z8aPO",
              "name": "Phases",
              "width": 720,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "ka7td",
                  "name": "THE ASCENT",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": [
                    20,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IWNcF",
                      "name": "Kicker",
                      "fill": "#6F6B64",
                      "content": "01    THE ASCENT",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.6
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "iv1eZ",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "#1C1B19",
                      "content": "Applying heat.",
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "D7lKVs",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "We begin with gentle, consistent warmth. Not a push. A saturation. Sonic frequencies and guided attention invite you to meet the places that have gone rigid, without resisting them. Loving the way you are now is what lets those patterns loosen, expand, and become malleable.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "Ls5sR",
                  "name": "Rule",
                  "fill": "#D8D4CC",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "eMIjL",
                  "name": "THE APEX",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": [
                    20,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "AjSsX",
                      "name": "Kicker",
                      "fill": "#6F6B64",
                      "content": "02    THE APEX",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.6
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IDnfr",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "#1C1B19",
                      "content": "Cruising altitude.",
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "RpptJ",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The field is soft, and no longer locked in its old configuration. This is not a fight with who you have been. It is a hold: expanded, workable, creative. New connections are available because nothing is being forced into place.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "B3rEEA",
                  "name": "Rule",
                  "fill": "#D8D4CC",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "dOsez",
                  "name": "THE DESCENT",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": [
                    20,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "O0Pty2",
                      "name": "Kicker",
                      "fill": "#6F6B64",
                      "content": "03    THE DESCENT",
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.6
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "yXWHA",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "#1C1B19",
                      "content": "Slow cooling.",
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "D5sz0D",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "This is the phase that matters most. Inside a container that stays safe, the energy recedes and the field is guided to settle. It does not snap back into the stressed shape. It finds a more integrated one. You land in yourself, re-patterned.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "q3ZUs",
          "name": "Other columns",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 28,
          "padding": [
            8,
            80,
            80,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "SWLcf",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#D8D4CC",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "elche",
              "name": "Kicker",
              "fill": "#6F6B64",
              "content": "ABOARD",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1.8
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "CuvLO",
              "name": "Open",
              "width": 680,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 14,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LbWeV",
                  "name": "Headline",
                  "fill": "#1C1B19",
                  "content": "Who it is for, and how you arrive.",
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 44,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "E0Zzx",
                  "name": "Deck",
                  "fill": "#3A3834",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The flight is a personal journey held in a communal way. It is light enough to enter, and serious enough to meet you where you actually are.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "A6qFT",
              "name": "Pair",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 48,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "bbwSu",
                  "name": "Player 2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "E0Y8c5",
                      "name": "Label",
                      "gap": 10,
                      "alignItems": "center",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "rectangle",
                          "id": "GOo6N",
                          "name": "Swatch",
                          "fill": "#1C1B19",
                          "width": 18,
                          "height": 2
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "DtzQq",
                          "name": "Name",
                          "fill": "#6F6B64",
                          "content": "THE PASSENGER",
                          "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "letterSpacing": 1.4
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "T8VhkS",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "#1C1B19",
                      "content": "If the loop is familiar.",
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ow9WS",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "For anyone stuck in a repetitive emotional or mental pattern. For anyone who wants the charge of an old stress to move, without a fight. For anyone ready to go from contraction toward awareness and coherence, and willing to do that from inside their own experience.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "SnAYq",
                  "name": "Player 3",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "znJ2f",
                      "name": "Label",
                      "gap": 10,
                      "alignItems": "center",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "rectangle",
                          "id": "kk3eY",
                          "name": "Swatch",
                          "fill": "#1C1B19",
                          "width": 18,
                          "height": 2
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "HJhV7",
                          "name": "Name",
                          "fill": "#6F6B64",
                          "content": "THE VESSEL",
                          "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "letterSpacing": 1.4
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "G2wYQ3",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "#1C1B19",
                      "content": "A room, not a runway.",
                      "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rytgF",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "#3A3834",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Comfortable clothes. An eye mask if you want one. A journal for after you land. The space is low-lit and made for lying down. The airplane is a metaphor you can rest inside: neither simply real nor not real, precise enough to hold a transformation.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Sans",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "CMDwf",
          "name": "Takeaway",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#1C1B19",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": [
            72,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "O5XCm",
              "name": "Kicker",
              "fill": "#B7B2A9",
              "content": "WELCOME ABOARD",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ybuoU",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "#F3F1EC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 760,
              "content": "You do not cross a geographic border.\nYou are given a frame for perception itself.\nThe trip is to the imaginal planes.",
              "lineHeight": 1.25,
              "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
